  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design Challenge and Knowledge Exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to inspire, support and build the capacity of knowledge institutes in Upper Egypt, towards more entrepreneurial education, through a design challenge, also called a Co-Create My City (CCMC). The design challenge will provide an example of how a practical student competition around local agri-challenges can stimulate and facilitate fruitful collaboration between the private sector, the government and knowledge institutes, and show the value of more practical and entrepreneurial forms of education. The heavy involvement of lecturers will serve as capacity strengthening and empower them to integrate entrepreneurial forms of teaching in their current curricula.</narrative>
  </description>
